1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:02,737
51 game sudah mereka buat,

2
00:00:02,757 --> 00:00:04,455
belum satu pun jadi hit milik

3
00:00:04,475 --> 00:00:05,150
sendiri.

4
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:08,463
Lalu game ke-52 menyelamatkan

5
00:00:08,483 --> 00:00:10,730
studio ini dari kebangkrutan.

6
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:11,845
Namanya Rovio,

7
00:00:11,865 --> 00:00:13,671
studio kecil dari Finlandia

8
00:00:13,691 --> 00:00:15,297
yang didirikan tiga mahasiswa

9
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:16,631
pada 2003.

10
00:00:16,651 --> 00:00:17,962
Bertahun-tahun mereka membuat

11
00:00:17,982 --> 00:00:19,138
game pesanan untuk perusahaan

12
00:00:19,158 --> 00:00:19,954
lain.

13
00:00:19,974 --> 00:00:21,378
Awal 2009,

14
00:00:21,398 --> 00:00:22,969
Rovio di ambang bangkrut.

15
00:00:22,989 --> 00:00:24,533
Karyawannya menyusut dari 50

16
00:00:24,553 --> 00:00:26,220
orang menjadi 12.

17
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,783
Uangnya hanya cukup untuk satu

18
00:00:27,803 --> 00:00:28,471
game lagi.

19
00:00:28,491 --> 00:00:30,871
Desainer Jaakko Iisalo lalu

20
00:00:30,891 --> 00:00:32,589
menggambar burung-burung

21
00:00:32,609 --> 00:00:33,872
berwajah marah,

22
00:00:33,892 --> 00:00:36,025
tanpa sayap dan tanpa kaki.

23
00:00:36,045 --> 00:00:37,496
Musuhnya babi hijau,

24
00:00:37,516 --> 00:00:39,075
konon terinspirasi berita flu

25
00:00:39,095 --> 00:00:39,637
babi.

26
00:00:39,657 --> 00:00:40,907
Mainnya sederhana:

27
00:00:40,927 --> 00:00:41,867
tarik ketapel,

28
00:00:41,887 --> 00:00:42,966
lepaskan burung,

29
00:00:42,986 --> 00:00:44,526
robohkan menara babi.

30
00:00:44,546 --> 00:00:46,171
Digarap delapan bulan,

31
00:00:46,191 --> 00:00:47,487
biayanya membengkak empat kali

32
00:00:47,507 --> 00:00:49,869
lipat, jadi sekitar €100.000.

33
00:00:49,889 --> 00:00:52,083
11 Desember 2009,

34
00:00:52,103 --> 00:00:53,848
Angry Birds rilis di iPhone

35
00:00:53,868 --> 00:00:56,124
seharga US$0,99.

36
00:00:56,144 --> 00:00:57,486
Februari 2010,

37
00:00:57,506 --> 00:00:59,158
ia jadi aplikasi berbayar

38
00:00:59,178 --> 00:01:00,646
nomor satu di Inggris,

39
00:01:00,666 --> 00:01:01,890
lalu Amerika.

40
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:03,376
Unduhannya menembus 1 miliar

41
00:01:03,396 --> 00:01:04,831
pada 2012,

42
00:01:04,851 --> 00:01:06,642
lalu lebih dari 5 miliar.

43
00:01:06,662 --> 00:01:09,344
Filmnya meraup US$352 juta.

44
00:01:09,364 --> 00:01:10,738
Tahun 2023,

45
00:01:10,758 --> 00:01:12,270
Sega membeli Rovio senilai

46
00:01:12,290 --> 00:01:13,931
€706 juta.

47
00:01:13,951 --> 00:01:16,034
Jadi, 51 game itu bukan

48
00:01:16,054 --> 00:01:18,464
sia-sia, melainkan latihan.

49
00:01:18,484 --> 00:01:20,013
Kamu tipe yang menyerah,

50
00:01:20,033 --> 00:01:21,708
atau mencoba sekali lagi?

51
00:01:21,728 --> 00:01:23,133
Tulis di komentar,

52
00:01:23,153 --> 00:01:25,101
dan ikuti AUDIRA TECH.

